Unmodified OE indeed wants you to top-post. However, there's no need to
change newsreader. I use OE as well, and it's fine for me. However, I
use a little add-on: OE-quotefix. It's really handy: it fixes line
length, it puts your insertion point at the correct place, puts your
signature at the bottom, etc.

When you read messages in OE, it additionally colours different quoting
levels, so it's much easier to see who wrote what.

I've been using it for years now, and haven't found it flawed in any
way. I recommend it: http://home.in.tum.de/~jain/software/oe-quotefix/

